  I got bored and wrote a small program that changes the
 dogname, catname, and fruit options in the Nethack.cnf
 file using entries from another text file.  I did this
 because I sometimes run across a ghost with a mean pet
 that is named the same as my friendly pet.  If anybody
 wants it I can upload it or mail it.  It's written in 
 microsoft C and only works for PC's but I'm sure some 
 equally bored Mac/Amiga people can translate the pc 
 specific bits.  I don't think this code is of much use
 to mainframe players who get to encounter other's ghosts.

